35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, our software holdings report only their own dashboards. This opacity threatens our quarter-end clarity. We must prioritize verifiable data.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, the data confirms my suspicion. The shopkeeper tool lost a third of accounts after price hikes. We cannot ignore this churn.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, the credit line ignores our contracts. We are borrowing against dead assets. This limits our flexibility for future calls.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, this is huge! Recruiters can’t find field crews fast enough, and our advisers are sitting idle. We’re stuck!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Minako, the credit line ignores our contracts. @Servas, security reviews take three quarters for regulated clients. We are signing up for external delays.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, three quarters is unacceptable. It disrupts our reporting rhythm. We need a candidate whose data flows independently, not through their own dashboard.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, I agree. The bank tool’s consistent releases prove reliability. We must invest in that stability, not the shopkeeper’s churn.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
